# .dockerignore — the compose build context is the REPO ROOT, and this repo is
# 5.8 GB. Without this file every `docker build` uploads (or, with BuildKit's
# lazy context, is at least willing to walk) 860 MB of War3*.mpq / *.w3x source
# archives, 338 MB of node_modules, 3.0 GB of tools/ ML model weights and a
# 116 MB .git. BuildKit's laziness is what kept the platform image at 14.5 s
# before this file existed — i.e. the cost was latent, one non-BuildKit build
# away from being real. Added in #176 alongside the two Dockerfile fixes that
# made `docker compose build` work at all.
#
# WHAT MUST NOT BE ADDED HERE, and why each one is load-bearing:
#   tsconfig.base.json  every app tsconfig `extends` it; excluding it breaks
#                       the client/editor/admin builds outright.
#   pnpm-lock.yaml      --frozen-lockfile.
#   nginx/, tools/deploy/ggd-assets.sh, docker/edge-entrypoint.d/
#                       COPYd by edge.Dockerfile.
# data/ IS excluded: it is a RUNTIME MOUNT, never baked. That is deliberate and
# is the whole reason data/blizzard-overlay needs `make family-ship` — see
# docs/family-deploy.md.

# --- version control / editor ------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.claude
**/.DS_Store
*.swp

# --- installed / built artefacts ---------------------------------------------
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Warcraft III source archives (860 MB, importer input only) ---------------
*.mpq
*.MPQ
*.w3x
*.w3u
*.w3a

# --- offline tooling: ML weights, venvs, generated output (3.0 GB) ------------
tools/icon-gen/models
tools/icon-gen/out
tools/**/.venv
tools/**/__pycache__
tools/bgm-gen/out
tools/tts-gen/out
tools/lod-gen/out

# --- runtime state: mounted, never baked --------------------------------------
data
scratchpad

# --- secrets: must never enter an image layer ---------------------------------
.env
**/.env
docker/.env
deploy/helm/secrets.local.yaml
deploy/helm/**/secrets*.yaml
**/*.htpasswd

# --- docs / reports -----------------------------------------------------------
docs
*.md
!content/**/*.md
